    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Right in Draguignan, this brasserie-restaurant offers a classic brasserie menu, open continuously in the morning and with extended service on certain evenings. Warm, friendly atmosphere, with the owner's welcome praised and prices considered reasonable according to consistent reviews. One customer came for lunch with their small dog and was warmly welcomed — this confirmation could not be found in a second independent source during our latest check, without being contradicted either.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The hours are worth noting: open Monday to Saturday from 9am to 3pm, with an extra evening service Wednesday to Saturday from 6pm to 1am. Closed Sunday.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: handy for lunch or a daytime coffee in central Draguignan with your dog, on weekdays as well as Saturday.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Central Draguignan and its shops are within easy reach to extend your outing.</p>
